{% extends "legal.njk" %}
{% block legal_title %}Delete your Pluto account{% endblock %}
{% block legal_content %}
<p>You can request deletion of your Pluto Events account and its associated personal data without signing in or reinstalling the app. Pluto Events LLC handles requests by email.</p>
<section class="legal-request" aria-labelledby="request"><h2 id="request">Send a deletion request</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email <a href="mailto:contact@pluto.events?subject=Pluto%20account%20deletion%20request">contact@pluto.events</a>, preferably from the email address associated with your Pluto account.</li>
    <li>Use the subject <strong>Pluto account deletion request</strong> and state that you want your account and associated personal data deleted. If your account is on our staging test site or staging app, please mention that.</li>
    <li>Our team will verify ownership, explain any information we need to retain and respond with the expected completion timeframe. If you cannot access your account email, contact us for help verifying ownership.</li>
  </ol>
  <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:contact@pluto.events?subject=Pluto%20account%20deletion%20request&body=Please%20delete%20my%20Pluto%20Events%20account%20and%20associated%20personal%20data.%0A%0AAccount%20email%3A%20%0AProduction%20or%20staging%3A%20">Request account deletion</a>
  <p>If the button does not open an email app, write to the address above using your preferred email service. Never include your password, full card number or identity documents in the initial request.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="deleted"><h2 id="deleted">What gets deleted</h2>
  <p>After verifying the request, we delete your sign-in account and delete or anonymize associated personal data eligible for deletion, including your profile details and photo, rewards profile and unnecessary account-linked activity or communications data. We coordinate deletion with service providers where appropriate.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="retained"><h2 id="retained">What may need to be retained</h2>
  <p>Limited purchase, payment, tax, refund, dispute, admission-security and signed-waiver records may be retained when required for accounting, legal obligations, resolving disputes or preventing fraud. Retention lasts only as long as those purposes require and varies by record. We will explain relevant exceptions and expected retention when responding to your request.</p>
  <p>Account deletion does not automatically cancel tickets or refund purchases. If you have an upcoming event or an unresolved order, mention it so we can explain how deletion affects ticket access. We will not require you to buy anything or reinstall the app to make a request.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="other"><h2 id="other">Other privacy requests</h2>
  <p>You can also request correction or deletion of specific personal information without deleting your whole account. Email us with the details. For more about data handling, read our <a href="/privacy#retention">Privacy Policy</a>. Uninstalling the app, signing out or clearing browser data alone does not delete server-side records.</p>
</section>
{% endblock %}
